# The enters trigger needs a target card in a graveyard: with both graveyards empty when the Lantern is cast on turn 1 it is removed from the stack (nothing is asked, nothing exiled). Bot1 then Bolts Bot2, so its own graveyard holds a Lightning Bolt,
# and Bot2's discards to hand size leave Islands in its graveyard. On turn 5 "{T}, Sacrifice: Exile each opponent's graveyard" exiles both of Bot2's Islands and leaves Bot1's Bolt.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Soul-Guide Lantern
Lightning Bolt
Island x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Soul-Guide Lantern.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Pass
? Exile.Count = 0
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
? Bot2.Graveyard.Count = 2
Bot1.Battlefield.Soul-Guide Lantern.Activate(Ability: Exile each opponent's graveyard)
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Pass

[Expect]
Stack.Count = 0
Exile.Count = 2
Bot2.Graveyard.Count = 0
Bot1.Graveyard = Soul-Guide Lantern
